<title>USA: CATTLE-FAX average feedlot cattle prices - July 18.</title>
<headline>CATTLE-FAX average feedlot cattle prices - July 18.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average prices for feedlot steers in the main U.S. six-state and three-state regions, according to CATTLE-FAX (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>6 STATES -</p>
<p> Thursday	  July 17  $64.27    up 0.23</p>
<p> Wednesday	 July 16  $64.04    up 1.07</p>
<p> Tuesday	   July 15  $62.97    up 0.86</p>
<p>3 STATES -</p>
<p> Thursday	  July 17  $63.97    up 0.37</p>
<p> Wednesday	 July 16  $63.60    up 1.44</p>
<p> Tuesday	   July 15  $62.16    up 0.51</p>
<p>Note: 6 states include TX, NE, KS, CO, OK, IA.</p>
<p>	    3 states include TX, KS, OK.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
